WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.630
Have you given any thought

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.465
to where this ends?

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:10.802
The Table will never stop.

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:12.721
You know this.

00:00:18.643 --> 00:00:19.310
No one,

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.021
not even you,

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.152
can kill everyone.

00:00:39.414 --> 00:00:41.207
You ready, John?

00:00:45.628 --> 00:00:46.755
Yeah.

